==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Red Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn, delay 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.
**6 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 1.33~2 seconds<sup>40f~60f</sup>.
**3 [[Christmas D.|Christmas Ds]] spawn, delay 93.33~94 seconds<sup>2,800f~2,820f</sup>.
**3 [[Christmas D.|Christmas Ds]] spawn, delay 93.33~94 seconds<sup>2,800f~2,820f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 66.67~67.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,020f</sup>.

